5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move desks, I need to understand the financial baseline.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if the current spots are actually comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My schedule is tight. I need to know how much time this change steals.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We always shuffle seats without asking who suffers the most. Let’s fix that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about who sits next to whom. It changes how we talk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,@Minato Comfort is subjective. I need hard numbers on the floor’s cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"But if my back hurts, I can’t work. I want that noted.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria Numbers are good, but I care about the daily friction.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,@May Friction is real. But so is the unfairness of the current layout.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Shunichi Yes. The layout dictates my social access. I want that measured.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the billing basis and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I want to check the physio note and the sound readings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I need the arrival times and the morning routine upstairs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll review the past shuffles and the staff survey plan.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I want to see the survey plan and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Let’s see what the data says before we commit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the sound data shows where it’s too loud.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I hope the arrival data shows how chaotic mornings are.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I hope the survey shows who was ignored last time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the joiner reports show if they feel included.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
