35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The billing is by area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen monthly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,The physio note says my chair needs days to settle. The sound is louder by the printer.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,@Victoria That’s a fixed cost. But the badge data shows we arrive at different times.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,@Victoria So the cost is the same. The pain is not.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,@Shunichi The survey shows the window seats are the most wanted. The joiners said they learned by overhearing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke Overhearing is a risk. The quote is 6,200 yen per desk to move.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria If I sit by the window, the sound is lower. My back will be happier.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,@Minato The pilot floor took up to nine minutes to set up. That’s time I don’t have.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,@May Nine minutes is nothing compared to the weeks of shuffling we’ve had.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May I agree. But if I sit by the window, I can hear the team better.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The quote means every change costs 6,200 yen. We should pick a layout and stick to it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we should put the quietest spots for people who need to focus.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,I want a layout that minimizes the setup time. I can’t afford to lose those gaps.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,I want a layout that is fair. Not just comfortable for some.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I want a layout where I can actually talk to people. Not just sit near them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"So we have three priorities: cost, comfort, and connection. We need to choose.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we choose comfort. It’s the only thing I can feel.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I hope we choose efficiency. It’s the only thing I can measure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I hope we choose fairness. It’s the only thing that matters.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope we choose connection. It’s the only thing that keeps me here.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
