60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A is the only one that stops the 6,200 yen quote from hitting us again.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A means I can keep my chair setting. That is very good for my back.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Option C is a disaster. I arrive late. I will always be scrambling for a desk.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is chaos. Option B is just delayed chaos. Option A is the only stable one.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A means I know who is next to me. I can plan my conversations.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,@Daisuke Yes. And it means the billing stays flat. No surprise costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,@Victoria I agree. The sound is lower at the window. I can sit there.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato If I sit by the window, I can hear less. But I still have to set up.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,@May You will have a fixed spot. No more scrambling. No more shuffling.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Shunichi Yes. And I can sit near the people I need to talk to.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I am voting for A. It is the only rational choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am voting for A. It is the only one that lets me be comfortable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,I am voting for A. It is the only one that respects my time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for A. It is the only one that is fair.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am voting for A. It is the only one that lets me connect.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Unanimous. We will go with A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am happy. My back will be happy.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I am happy. My schedule will be happy.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am happy. The unfairness is gone.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am happy. I can finally talk to my team.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
